        "PMC10142552::web::001::1_introduction",
        "PMC9787501::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "A 1–2 at.% Al addition is sufficient to produce the proposed oxidation benefit.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al addition will cause in situ formation of a continuous, dense Al2O3 scale.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::web::001::1_introduction",
        "PMC9787501::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al2O3 scale will adhere to the alloy surface.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Added Al will oxidize preferentially relative to the other alloy constituents.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The continuous protective oxide scale will inhibit further oxidation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::web::001::1_introduction",
        "PMC9787501::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide scale acts as a diffusion barrier that impedes oxygen ingress into the substrate.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9787501::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to the untreated alloy, the Al-modified alloy will show reduced oxygen uptake and weight gain.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::web::001::1_introduction",
        "PMC9787501::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to the untreated alloy, the Al-modified alloy will have a lower oxidation rate.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::web::001::1_introduction",
        "PMC9787501::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The untreated refractory high-entropy alloy typically forms less-protective or discontinuous oxides that permit greater oxygen transport and weight gain.",
